<<<
pneumatic, pneumonia, &c. The

OED gives nū- only for these particular words, but prefers pnii- for less familiar words from the same stems, such as pneumatology, pneumonometer. It is to be hoped that these silent letters may recover their voices now that everyone can read; cf. PHTHISIS, PSYCHOLOGY.
===
**pneumatic, pneumonia,** &c. The OED gives nū- only for these particular words, but prefers pnū- for less familiar words from the same stems, such as *pneumatology, pneumonometer.* It is to be hoped that these silent letters may recover their voices now that everyone can read; cf. ^^PHTHISIS^^, ^^PSYCHOLOGY^^.
>>>

