*-ical* is the form for ' written in verse ', & *-ic* for ' instinct with poetry ' (*Poetical composition; The -ic impulse*); *-ical* is the commonplace, & *-ic* the rhetorical form (*In a poetical mood; but In -ic mood*);
>>>

<<<
