mens is:—an, conj.; aught; beau-

teous; broidery; canorous;
===
*advertising soapboiler*).

**POETICISMS.** Simple reference of words to this article warns the reader that to use them in ordinary prose contexts is dangerous; see also ^^INCONGRUOUS VOCABULARY^^. A small haphazard collection of specimens is:—*an,* conj.; *aught*; *beauteous*; *broidery*; *canorous*;
>>>

